ea:SystematicError a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ErrorScore .
ea:ErrorScore owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:RandomError ea:SystematicError ) .
ea:TestScoreComponent owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:TrueScore ea:ErrorScore ) .

